{"4154110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beyond The Second Hour", "steam_appid": 4154110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the Second Clock redefines strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your soldiers to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are tons of soldiers and multiple levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game gets harder as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to use your soldiers' strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, your soldiers don't wait for you to press a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They think, react, and survive on their own. Each unit is an individual with its own intuition, awareness, and decision-making abilities. You give the orders, and they decide how to execute them based on what's happening around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no numerical advantages, no predetermined outcomes, and no disparity in strength. A single bullet, a change in the weather, or a well-placed flank can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is an emergent story—not built on scripted lines, but on the chaos of real-time simulation.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the Second Clock redefines strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your soldiers to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are tons of soldiers and multiple levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game gets harder as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to use your soldiers' strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, your soldiers don't wait for you to press a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They think, react, and survive on their own. Each unit is an individual with its own intuition, awareness, and decision-making abilities. You give the orders, and they decide how to execute them based on what's happening around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no numerical advantages, no predetermined outcomes, and no disparity in strength. A single bullet, a change in the weather, or a well-placed flank can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is an emergent story—not built on scripted lines, but on the chaos of real-time simulation.</p>", "short_description": "Beyond The Second Hour is a tactical strategy war game where every soldier has his own brain. There are no stats, no power levels — just real shots, reactions, and environmental chaos shaping every battle.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154110/7c622fc8f2152c3dd52de024d210bd912475b2ef/header.jpg?t=1767306490", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154110/2eb79d4d897f7fdb671008f518301ab505792729/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767306490", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154110/2eb79d4d897f7fdb671008f518301ab505792729/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767306490", "website": "https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61579610345578", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 / 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 (3rd Gen) or AMD FX-4100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 / AMD R7 250 / Intel HD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound device</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong